  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.6px; color: rgb(18, 18, 18); line-height: 1.2; word-break: break-word; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 2px 2px 4px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 247, 244); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\">We Turn Your Favorite Photos Into Cozy Keepsakes</h1><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 800px; margin: 0px auto; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 247, 244); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">ThatBlanket was born from a simple idea: your memories deserve better than a phone screen. We create custom photo blankets that let you wrap yourself in the moments that matter most.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 800px; margin: 0px auto; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 247, 244); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.6px; color: rgb(216, 88, 57); line-height: 1.3; word-break: break-word; font-size: 2.5em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\">Our Story</h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.9; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Every blanket we make is printed right here in the United States using advanced dye-sublimation technology. This isn't your average photo gift – we're talking edge-to-edge printing on premium fleece that stays soft and vibrant wash after wash.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.9; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">We've helped our customers transform their favorite photos into something they can actually use and enjoy every day. Whether it's grandparents snuggling under photos of their grandkids, couples celebrating anniversaries, or pet parents honoring their furry friends, we're here to turn those precious moments into lasting comfort.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.9; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" id=\"isPasted\">All our blankets are printed and shipped from our facility in the United States. We're proud to support American jobs and keep quality control in-house.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.5em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.6px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">When you order from ThatBlanket, you're not just getting a premium product – you're supporting American manufacturing and helping create jobs right here at home</p></div></div>",
